<lb n="7"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leyder</unclear> noch inn wäsen ist, uff den <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">xxiij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>Novembris</date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechsthin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verrückt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogeschriben</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>unnd ir unns daruff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bii</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anntwürt</unclear> geben, des
<lb n="10"/>alles <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habenn</unclear> ir üch (als unns nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwyfflet</unclear>)
<lb n="11"/>noch wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerinnern</unclear>, Diewyl nun unns erst
<lb n="12"/>diser tagen, von kü. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frannckrych</unclear></placeName> uff
<lb n="13"/>das schryben so üwer unnd unnser lieb eydt-
<lb n="14"/>gnossen, von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-13" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bern</placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Schaffhusen</placeName> unnd
<lb n="15"/>wir an ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. (wie wir dann inn unnserm
<lb n="16"/>schryben gegen üch vermeldet) gethan, ein
<lb n="17"/>schrifftliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anntwürt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokumen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habenn</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>wir üch söllichs guoter meinung nit verhalten
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear>, unnd schickent üch darvon hieby
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ligennde</unclear> abschrifft zuo, damit ir üch darinn
<lb n="21"/>ersehen mögen Unnd so dann kü. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>.,
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrybenns</unclear>, uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzelten</unclear> ursachen
<lb n="23"/>vermeint, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ietzmal</unclear> nit von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noeten</unclear> sin, unnser
<lb n="24"/>der vier stetten ouch annderer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orthen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogewannten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathsbottschafften</unclear> inn <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Frannck-
